    },
    {
      "id": "a9c66e93-08d9-50e7-8416-d96a7c928c4e",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 3,
      "x": 340,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": null,
      "content": "합동 훈련을 마친 {name}{wa} {name2}{i} 함께 다가온다.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Fresh from joint training, {name} and {name2} come over together.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cd29c942-cfcd-51d0-b70b-23505e779d8b",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 4,
      "x": 640,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "오늘 {name2}랑 합 맞춰 봤는데 꽤 괜찮았어요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "I synced up with {name2} today, and it went pretty well.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ee7b3eb2-278d-503c-a8a9-5a0e82e68f10",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 5,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "6b1de2e5-536b-5673-b2c0-0f81cf838865",
      "content": "제가 받쳐 준 덕분이죠.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Thanks to me backing you up.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7c2a7cd1-0c8f-5d68-8de2-21c60f36c91a",
      "type": "Comment",
      "name": "Comment",
      "localId": 6,
      "x": 340,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "text": "합동 훈련 이벤트 설정",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
      "attachments": [
        {
          "nodeId": "a9c66e93-08d9-50e7-8416-d96a7c928c4e"
        }
      ],
      "sharedValues": {
        "9b6e516f-a52b-57b9-9d75-3e14f3f79f0b": "talk_pair",
        "b601620d-b79b-5e63-9a68-49a1070d87a2": -1,
        "dc77a7fd-a7a7-5d59-9b76-6644fb3a0f39": 0,
        "07a3d5e1-0c04-57db-93dc-82f43a608ae4": "",
        "71b9ee95-9045-598b-84be-6e0cf08405b2": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f499d9cc-3303-5912-bdd6-f42c4a4b6a9b",
      "type": "Select",
      "name": "Select",
      "localId": 7,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "9cd8da8d-02f3-5390-8263-b1236fba61a8",
          "text": "둘 다 잘했어. 그 호흡 그대로 가자.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "478c4b42-e58a-5a6c-b168-228f5671915c": "trust:+2;stress:-3"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "3f9fc79c-fac8-56f9-8b45-e7ae82cf4e51",
          "text": "아직 부족해. 내일 한 번 더 맞춰 봐.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "478c4b42-e58a-5a6c-b168-228f5671915c": "ok>pmod:all:+1:-1;ng>stress:+3"
          }
        }
      ],
      "translations": {
        "opt:9cd8da8d-02f3-5390-8263-b1236fba61a8": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "You both did well. Keep that rhythm.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        },
        "opt:3f9fc79c-fac8-56f9-8b45-e7ae82cf4e51": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Not there yet. Sync up once more tomorrow.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d5e74958-f2d8-5a45-bc5f-6a8c16c7c69d",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 8,
      "x": 1540,
      "y": -90,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "들었지? 감독님도 인정하셨어.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Hear that? Even the coach approves.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "15040e6e-5cd7-5c05-a2ef-eab992567a20",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 9,
      "x": 1840,
      "y": -90,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "6b1de2e5-536b-5673-b2c0-0f81cf838865",
      "content": "다음엔 내가 앞에 설게.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Next time I'll take the lead.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1d843546-a051-5eff-becb-26605db6edc3",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 10,
      "x": 1540,
      "y": 170,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "6b1de2e5-536b-5673-b2c0-0f81cf838865",
      "content": "좋아요, 내일은 더 맞춰 볼게요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Okay, we'll sync up even more tomorrow.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "ee115aa3-43e4-5f4a-a390-903f044858b8": "ok"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "caaaafe9-fe5f-587e-8451-cbb8d9e090f2",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 11,
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 170,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "…둘이 또요?",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "...The two of us again?",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "ee115aa3-43e4-5f4a-a390-903f044858b8": "ng"
      }
    }
  ],
